{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">昔日 TVB 花旦劉美娟與丈夫張崇德結婚多年，感情一直非常恩愛。轉眼間，二人的愛女張日晴已經迎來 18 歲大個女！日前，劉美娟與張崇德偕同兒子張日希，一家人特意遠赴加拿大，為囡囡精心舉辦浪漫的 18 歲成人禮生日會，並於社交平台分享了一家四口的溫馨合照，隨即吸引大批網民留言洗版送上祝福。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"03cacfb3-d65e-4beb-9598-c423ec47d56b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026L0yMmyLkkv1790651760.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"03cacfb3-d65e-4beb-9598-c423ec47d56b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，身為壽星女的張日晴真的是「女大十八變」！她留著一頭長捲髮、身穿黑色上衣，笑意盈盈地手捧寫有「Happy 18th Birthday Ching」的生日蛋糕。五官精緻且氣質出眾的她，笑起來眼睛彎彎，被不少網民狂讚完美遺傳了媽咪劉美娟的優良基因。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f18f51db-8188-41e6-a9c1-3312b0e7513f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266EeV5QOh5j1790651760.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f18f51db-8188-41e6-a9c1-3312b0e7513f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"582a071a-563a-44e3-a0cd-96c4ca8aa681.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026rpPVQjmTAh1790651759.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"582a071a-563a-44e3-a0cd-96c4ca8aa681.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">夫婦二人除了分享當下的慶生照，更晒出女兒在成長過程中的紀念照片。張崇德感性又開心地上載合照並寫道：「我個寶貝女18歲喇！18歲生日怎可以自己過呢？所以，我和太太同個仔在Montreal陪她過，yeah！」場面相當溫馨融洽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T03:39:50.159532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}